OL,3,GEast Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FCloudy
OL,6,Fthrough the evening with showers
OL,7,Fpossible. These likely dying away
OL,8,Fmidnight, with clear spells
OL,9,Fdeveloping. Light winds at first,
OL,10,Fstrengthening through the evening to
OL,11,Fbecome breezy overnight.
OL,12,
OL,13,CThursday:FDry and bright at first with
OL,14,Fsome sunny spells. Cloud soon
OL,15,Fthickening from the west, bringing
OL,16,Foutbreaks of rain in the afternoon,
OL,17,Fwith heavy bursts possible in the
OL,18,Fearly hours.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
